      "summaries": {
        "en": "Open Notebook is an open-source alternative to NotebookLM, designed to help you take smarter notes and learn more effectively. It uses AI to organize your notes, generate summaries, and connect ideas across documents. What makes it special is its flexibility—you can customize workflows, integrate with local models, and control your data. Try it for research, study, or personal knowledge management; clone the repo, run it locally, and start building your own AI-powered notebook.",
        "zh": "Open Notebook 是一个开源的智能笔记工具，旨在替代 NotebookLM，帮助你更高效地学习和整理知识。它利用 AI 自动组织笔记、生成摘要，并跨文档关联想法。其核心优势在于高度灵活：你可以自定义工作流、接入本地模型，并完全掌控自己的数据。无论是做研究、复习备考，还是构建个人知识库，你都可以克隆仓库、本地运行，亲手打造一个 AI 增强的笔记本。",
        "es": "Open Notebook is an open-source alternative to NotebookLM, designed to help you take smarter notes and learn more effectively. It uses AI to organize your notes, generate summaries, and connect ideas across documents. What makes it special is its flexibility—you can customize workflows, integrate with local models, and control your data. Try it for research, study, or personal knowledge management; clone the repo, run it locally, and start building your own AI-powered notebook.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "open-notebook stands out for assistant, learning, and note-taking in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "Open Notebook is an open-source alternative to NotebookLM, designed to help you take smarter notes and learn more effectively. It uses AI to organize your notes, generate summaries, and connect ideas across documents. What makes it special is its flexibility—you can customize workflows, integrate with local models, and control your data. Try it for research, study, or personal knowledge management; clone the repo, run it locally, and start building your own AI-powered notebook.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/lfnovo/open-notebook for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
