      "summaries": {
        "en": "Copilot SDK is a multi-platform Java library that enables developers to integrate GitHub Copilot's AI-powered code completion into their own applications and services. Its key technical strength lies in abstracting the Copilot Agent protocol into a clean, reusable API, handling authentication, streaming responses, and context management. You can use it to build custom IDE plugins, chat interfaces, or automated code review tools that leverage Copilot's capabilities without reinventing the wheel.",
        "zh": "Copilot SDK 是一个多平台 Java 库，旨在让开发者轻松将 GitHub Copilot 的 AI 代码补全能力集成到自己的应用和服务中。其核心技术亮点是将 Copilot Agent 的复杂协议抽象为简洁、可复用的 API，自动处理认证、流式响应和上下文管理，大大降低了接入门槛。你可以用它快速构建自定义 IDE 插件、智能聊天界面或自动化代码审查工具，无需从头实现底层通信。无论是增强现有开发环境，还是打造全新的 AI 辅助编程体验，这个 SDK 都提供了坚实的起点。",
        "es": "Copilot SDK is a multi-platform Java library that enables developers to integrate GitHub Copilot's AI-powered code completion into their own applications and services. Its key technical strength lies in abstracting the Copilot Agent protocol into a clean, reusable API, handling authentication, streaming responses, and context management. You can use it to build custom IDE plugins, chat interfaces, or automated code review tools that leverage Copilot's capabilities without reinventing the wheel.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "copilot-sdk gives teams a dependable path to production-ready AI tooling.",
          "what": "Copilot SDK is a multi-platform Java library that enables developers to integrate GitHub Copilot's AI-powered code completion into their own applications and services. Its key technical strength lies in abstracting the Copilot Agent protocol into a clean, reusable API, handling authentication, streaming responses, and context management. You can use it to build custom IDE plugins, chat interfaces, or automated code review tools that leverage Copilot's capabilities without reinventing the wheel.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/github/copilot-sdk for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
      },
