      "summaries": {
        "en": "E5-large-v2 is a text embedding model that converts sentences into dense vectors for semantic similarity and retrieval tasks. It uses contrastive learning on a massive dataset of paired text, achieving state-of-the-art performance on MTEB benchmarks. Technically, it employs a two-stage training pipeline: first pretraining with weak supervision from search logs, then fine-tuning with hard negatives. You can use it with Sentence Transformers to build semantic search, clustering, or classification systems. Its ONNX and OpenVINO support enables efficient deployment on CPUs.",
        "zh": "E5-large-v2 是一个文本嵌入模型，能将句子转换为稠密向量，用于语义相似度计算和检索任务。它通过对比学习在大量文本对数据上训练，在MTEB基准测试中达到领先水平。技术亮点在于两阶段训练流程：先用搜索日志中的弱监督信号进行预训练，再用难负样本微调。你可以通过Sentence Transformers库轻松使用它，构建语义搜索、聚类或分类系统。模型支持ONNX和OpenVINO格式，可在CPU上高效部署，适合生产环境。",
        "es": "E5-large-v2 is a text embedding model that converts sentences into dense vectors for semantic similarity and retrieval tasks. It uses contrastive learning on a massive dataset of paired text, achieving state-of-the-art performance on MTEB benchmarks. Technically, it employs a two-stage training pipeline: first pretraining with weak supervision from search logs, then fine-tuning with hard negatives. You can use it with Sentence Transformers to build semantic search, clustering, or classification systems. Its ONNX and OpenVINO support enables efficient deployment on CPUs.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "e5-large-v2 stands out for sentence-transformers, pytorch, and onnx in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "E5-large-v2 is a text embedding model that converts sentences into dense vectors for semantic similarity and retrieval tasks. It uses contrastive learning on a massive dataset of paired text, achieving state-of-the-art performance on MTEB benchmarks. Technically, it employs a two-stage training pipeline: first pretraining with weak supervision from search logs, then fine-tuning with hard negatives. You can use it with Sentence Transformers to build semantic search, clustering, or classification systems. Its ONNX and OpenVINO support enables efficient deployment on CPUs.",
          "how": "Review https://huggingface.co/intfloat/e5-large-v2 for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
